00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.690
Make sure to optimize
them as much as possible,

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.450
especially when you're first starting.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.450
So that YouTube,

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:31.410
'cause they don't really have
any other data about you,

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.590
except for the titles,
and the descriptions,

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:35.280
and the tags, and all
those types of things.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.870
And we actually have a
video over on Think Media

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:37.770
about how to rank videos.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.260
We'll link that up on the YouTube card

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.340
and so people can check that out.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.560
That goes a little bit more
into some of those tips.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.160
But make sure you optimize your video well

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.800
so you're giving YouTube the data,

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.700
the information about
what you're all about.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.960
And then put in the work, put in the time.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.140
And going into 2020, don't judge
your results if you've been

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.600
doing this for three weeks
and you only have four videos.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.497
Furthermore, if you've been
doing this for six months,

00:11:00.497 --> 00:11:03.100
but you upload every like, seven weeks,

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:05.610
and then you do two in a row,
and then you take some off.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:08.060
And it's also the quality
of the uploads, you know.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.860
If you just kinda shot
a video on your phone

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.660
that was like of your kid's graduation,

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.640
and then you did like a strategic video,

00:11:13.640 --> 00:11:15.510
and then you did two other
videos about something else.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:20.300
No, again, stop dabbling
and start dominating.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:22.770
Get really focused and build momentum

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:24.780
and consistency with strategy.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.520
That's how you get views in 2020.

